    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/d5d7afaf7f42e82c6dbbf1f34a9d1f50.poster.avif?t=1748471611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/d5d7afaf7f42e82c6dbbf1f34a9d1f50.webm?t=1748471611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/d5d7afaf7f42e82c6dbbf1f34a9d1f50.mp4?t=1748471611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Valiant Saga is a brutal 2D action-platformer with RPG elements.</strong> Explore cursed kingdoms filled with danger and mystery.<br><br><strong>Traverse a wide variety of hand-crafted environments</strong>, from snowy hills and dusty ruins to blood soaked catacombs and volcanic valleys.<br><br>Face hordes of abysmal creatures in intense battles, brought to life with dynamic pixel art and <strong>a powerful original power metal soundtrack.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/a8050c525095165914c4c7786b896ffb.avif?t=1748471611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crush enemies with your two-handed axe. Combo, dash, and execute your foes in blood-soaked battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/46c8f1cbef2bd800a26f22b889319208.poster.avif?t=1748471611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/46c8f1cbef2bd800a26f22b889319208.webm?t=1748471611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/46c8f1cbef2bd800a26f22b889319208.mp4?t=1748471611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/10f064139e857feedca7cc3dbf3f8995.avif?t=1748471611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hurl a fiery spinning axe and master devastating abilities like fire dashes and thunder strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/111d88121336cc1726226a66be297660.poster.avif?t=1748471611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/111d88121336cc1726226a66be297660.webm?t=1748471611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/111d88121336cc1726226a66be297660.mp4?t=1748471611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/ccd884a115e8e78acdda8b9ce45d652a.avif?t=1748471611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse a wide variety of handcrafted environments in pixel art, enhanced by dramatic lighting, weather, and rich environmental detail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/d71e6ee4ac6f2faf0eb680ba93955579.poster.avif?t=1748471611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/d71e6ee4ac6f2faf0eb680ba93955579.webm?t=1748471611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/d71e6ee4ac6f2faf0eb680ba93955579.mp4?t=1748471611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/ffd5919c39a1330f57b31a12f28848ba.avif?t=1748471611\" /></div>Solve challenging puzzles, help villagers, and overcome deadly dungeons traps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/e3b1005016622b946424773c266b5771.poster.avif?t=1748471611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/e3b1005016622b946424773c266b5771.webm?t=1748471611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/e3b1005016622b946424773c266b5771.mp4?t=1748471611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/df233425ec3b38cc2f73af36f9b33b0b.avif?t=1748471611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel the battle through a fully original and immersive power metal soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/d5d7afaf7f42e82c6dbbf1f34a9d1f50.poster.avif?t=1748471611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/d5d7afaf7f42e82c6dbbf1f34a9d1f50.webm?t=1748471611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/d5d7afaf7f42e82c6dbbf1f34a9d1f50.mp4?t=1748471611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Valiant Saga is a brutal 2D action-platformer with RPG elements.</strong> Explore cursed kingdoms filled with danger and mystery.<br><br><strong>Traverse a wide variety of hand-crafted environments</strong>, from snowy hills and dusty ruins to blood soaked catacombs and volcanic valleys.<br><br>Face hordes of abysmal creatures in intense battles, brought to life with dynamic pixel art and <strong>a powerful original power metal soundtrack.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/a8050c525095165914c4c7786b896ffb.avif?t=1748471611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crush enemies with your two-handed axe. Combo, dash, and execute your foes in blood-soaked battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/46c8f1cbef2bd800a26f22b889319208.poster.avif?t=1748471611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/46c8f1cbef2bd800a26f22b889319208.webm?t=1748471611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><s